l": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events", "type": "Bot", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "content_type": "application/vnd.android.package-archive", "state": "uploaded", "size": 44372938, "digest": "sha256:d6c532e060e895466b9f3aced24d76c52b6a984cd739cd3d0285d738229d6894", "download_count": 1592, "created_at": "2026-07-17T18:56:55Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-17T18:56:58Z", "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/komikku-app/komikku/releases/download/v1.14.1/Komikku-x86_64-v1.14.1.apk"}], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/komikku-app/komikku/tarball/v1.14.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/komikku-app/komikku/zipball/v1.14.1", "body": "[![GitHub downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/komikku-app/komikku/v1.14.1/total?label=Downloaded&labelColor=27303D&color=0D1117&logo=github&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=flat)](https://github.com/komikku-app/komikku/releases/v1.14.1)\r\n#### What's Changed\r\n##### Fix\r\n- **repo-migration**: Correct URL formatting when migrating repo (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **delegated-sources**: Fix loading delegated sources with latest extension DSL changes (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **chapter-hash**: Fix preference migration for existing users (@cuong-tran)\r\n\r\n#### v1.14.0\r\n##### New\r\n- **Extension**: Support `TachiyomiX 1.6` (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **Extension**: Change `extension repo` to `extension store` and add support for newer extension index format (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **Library**: Utilize tracker for library duplicate detection (@NarwhalHorns)\r\n- **Download**: Add option for bookmarked chapters to download dropdown (@NarwhalHorns)\r\n- **Note**: Remove text limit of manga notes (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **EH**: Update `EHTags` (@jobobby04)\r\n- **MAL**: Add informative error for unapproved MAL titles (@MajorTanya)\r\n- **Anilist**: Parse GraphQL error responses for downtime and token expiry (@itsmechinmoy)\r\n- **Logging**: Allow disable verbose log in Debug build (@cuong-tran)\r\n\r\n##### Improve\r\n- **Library**: Optimize tracked library filter (@NarwhalHorns)\r\n- **Update**: Run automatic library updates even when connected to a VPN (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **Shortcut**: Automate app shortcuts with shortcut-helper plugin (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **Sync**: Split \"sync on add\" into separate metadata and chapter fetch preferences (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **WebDAV**: Mask WebDAV password while typing (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **Database**: Add missing indexes to improve database query performance (@Lolle2000la)\r\n- **Database**: Optimize database indexes and clean up schema (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **UI**: Avoid race conditions and improve bulk selection (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **UI**: Refactor selection state management and improve performance across various screens (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **UI**: Add all pages of adjacent chapters in the UI instead of only the first or last three (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **Sync**: Add sync events to SyncYomi (@kaiserbh)\r\n- **Migrate**: Copy last page read in migrate (@jobobby04)\r\n- **UI**: Add haptic feedback before actions (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **MangaScreen**: Only `sync trackers` after update chapters (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **Extension**: Change the term `Obsolete` to `Orphaned` for extensions (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **Download**: Disable download `URL hash` inclusion by default (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **Notification**: Use plural forms for update error notification (@sudo-ezekiel)\r\n- **Source-api**: Check if extension supports `related manga` before making request (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **Network**: Remove `BrotliInterceptor` from default client (@AntsyLich)\r\n\r\n##### Fix\r\n- **MangaDex**: Fix `MangaDex delegated` (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **Merged-chapters**: Fix sorting `merged-manga`'s chapters by source order (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **Anilist**: Handle GraphQL error responses on HTTP error status codes (@itsmechinmoy)\r\n- **MangaDex**: Fix nullability issues in track creation for MangaDex (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **Extension**: Fix extension install/update stuck at pending (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **Extension**: Fix extension install/update stuck at installing (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **Extension**: Fix occasional crash when mass installing/uninstalling extension using `PackageManager` (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **Extension**: Fix ANR while installing extensions (@cuong-tran)\r\n- **Note**: Fix crash trying to select text in notes screen (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **Note**: Fix crash when putting app in background (@AntsyLich)\r\n- **Logging**: Prevent app crashes from logging before `XLog` initialization (@cuong-tran)\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: [komikku-app/komikku@...v1.14.1](https://github.com/komikku-app/komikku/compare/...v1.14.1)\r\n\r\n<!-->\r\n> [!TIP]\r\n>\r\n> ### If you are unsure which version to download then go with `Komikku-v1.14.1.apk`\r\n", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/komikku-app/komikku/releases/355866999/reactions", "total_count": 33, "+1": 19, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 5, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 9}, "mentions_count": 9}}